cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ground Truth in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ground Truth"
abstract: >-
  A twice-daily multi-agent job-search system run as an operations system. It
  reads job-alert email only (no scraping), screens with deterministic code,
  researches each listing back to the employer's own posting, scores fit from
  quoted evidence, and holds any tailored résumé claim that a separate checker
  cannot trace to the untouched master résumé. It never submits on its own.
  This repository carries the agents' plain-English instruction files, the
  screener and claims checker as standard-library Python, fictional runnable
  examples, and the guardrails.
authors:
